chnology services providers. The company was incorporated in 2008 and is based in Shanghai, China.","description_en":"Shanghai Able Digital Science&Tech Co., Ltd. provides digital teaching and learning solutions for higher education institutions in China. It offers digital educational content services and products, digital courses, knowledge graph, virtual simulation; digital teaching and learning environment services and products, such as AI cloud learning management system, and digital classroom environment services. It serves higher education institutions, including universities, colleges, and vocational schools, as well as teachers, and students. It sells its products through suppliers, such as cloud services provider, audiovisual hardware suppliers, and information technology services providers. The company was incorporated in 2008 and is based in Shanghai, China.","description_zh":"上海卓越睿新數碼科技股份有限公司為中國高等教育機構提供數碼教學與學習解決方案。該公司提供數碼教育內容服務與產品、數碼課程、知識圖譜、虛擬模擬；數碼教學與學習環境服務與產品，例如人工智能雲學習管理系統和數碼課堂環境服務。其服務對象包括大學、學院和職業學校等高等教育機構，以及教師和學生。該公司透過雲服務供應商、視聽硬件供應商和資訊科技服務供應商等供應商銷售其產品。公司於二零零八年註冊成立，總部位於中國上海。","address":"Rooms 901–904","city":"Shanghai","state":"SH","zip":"325400","country":"CN","phone":null,"full_address":"Rooms 901–904, Shanghai, SH, 325400, CN","year_high":374.6,"year_low":82,"range_52w":"82-374.6","all_time_high":null,"all_time_low":null,"inst_ownership_pct":null,"insider_ownership_pct":null,"top_holders":[],"insider_trades":[],"stock_splits":[],"news":[],"historical_dcf_series":null,"real_5y_prices":[],"dataAvailability":{"currentPrice":null,"hkdRiskFreeRate":"usdTreasuryProxyNotObservedHkdYield","asReportedLeases":"sourceUnavailable","ownership":"Provider coverage has not been verified for HKEX","historicalDcf":"No point-in-time historical valuations are available"},"ratingSources":{"fScore":{"asOfDate":null,"period":null,"basis":null,"evaluatedTests":0,"passedTests":0,"reason":"missingComparableStatements","evidenceHash":"eb9e7e2a605ac3aab2c392719b1a0d5852301f4932